# Source-controlled macOS release provenance for mbox 0.2.0.
#
# This is a fixed local Darwin arm64 release receipt.  It is valid only for
# the exact canonical source root and output path below.  It deliberately does
# not claim byte reproducibility for an arbitrary fresh checkout path: Mach-O
# LC_UUID and code-signature/linker output can vary with output path and host.
# source-fingerprint is SHA-256(sorted(relative-path<TAB>SHA-256(content))) for
# Cargo manifests/lock, admitted toolchain/config/build inputs, and every src
# file; unexpected binary-affecting inputs fail closed.
# The binary is not an input to this record, so the record is non-circular.
